('polity-governor', 'polity', 'Governor', 3, 'The Governor is the constitutional head of a state, appointed by the President, who mostly acts on the state government’s advice. The flashpoints are discretion: reserving bills for the President, choosing a Chief Minister when no party has a majority, and reports to the Centre.', null, array['polity-governor#0', 'polity-governor#1', 'polity-governor#2', 'polity-governor#3', 'polity-governor#4', 'polity-governor#5', 'polity-governor#6', 'polity-governor#7']::text[], 'published'),
